            "sid": "JOL 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izu daYehova denjili kudi mwana kaPetuweli Yoweli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu awakulumpi, tiyenu kunu, shenu matu kunu, enu wejima wenu mwashakama mwituŋa. Tiyenu chuma chabulahu dehi kumwekana mumafuku enu, hela mumafuku awankakulula jenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muyilejumu anyanenu, anyanenu nawa akalejumu anyanawu, anyanawu nawa akalejumu amba kavwalikamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yanashiyuwu ansenya, anayidyi kudi atubola amotokaŋa; yanashiyuwu atubola amotokaŋa, anayidyi kudi atubola adi nakutuuka; yanashiyuwu atubola adi nakutuuka, anayidyi kudi atubola akisaŋanaŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu akwakusheta, hindukenu mudili makumbu; enu mwanwaŋa walwa, kalokenu nyiteti nansaŋu yawalwa watowala; muloŋa anayihukuluwu kutunwa twenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa mwituŋa dami munenzi muza, wasweja Ŋovu, wakachindewaŋa; maji awu adi neyi maji amutupa, akweti mawunji adi neyi amutupa weneni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abola dehi nyivinyu yami, abalola dehi yikuyu yami; ayibwambola dehi, ayinata dehi niheseki; nyitayi yayu yatookoloka dehi to-o.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dilenu neyi mujiki wudi nakudila nfumwindi wahawusanda windi, navwali kwayikeleyi hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwitala daYehova kwaketuka dehi ninyilambu yawuŋa ninyilambu yakuhuŋununa. Atupristu, akwakukalakela Yehova, hiyakudila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumaha mwakisika dehi, ituŋa hidikudila; hiyakudila tidiku yakisika dehi, nivinyu yayiha yoma dehi chau, manji hiyakuzeela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu akwakudima, tiyenu nsonyi, enu akwakuloŋesha nyivinyu, kalokenu nyiteti, nansaŋu yatidiku nabali; muloŋa yakudya yakeŋa kwaŋulawu mumaha yinakisiki dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyivinyu yinomi dehi, yikuyu hiyikuzeela. Nyibula yakudima, ninyikoma, ninyitondu yanyikabu yacheŋi, kafwampi nyitondu yamumpata yejima yalepuka dehi; muloŋa kuluŋa kunakaŋanyi dehi kudi anyana kawantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu atupristu, vwalenu yikeleyi mudili; enu akwakukalakala kukameŋa, kalokenu nyiteti. Enu akwakukalakela Nzambi yami, inzenu mukami wufuku wejima muyikeleyi; muloŋa kwitala daNzambi yenu analekeshuku dehi nyilambu yawuŋa ninyilambu yakuhuŋununa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jilikenu ifuku dakuleka kudya, tambikenu chawija chakushiika. Pompeshenu awakulumpi niantu amwituŋa ejima, enzi kwitala daYehova Nzambi yenu, mwakadilili madilu kudi Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yayo, o difuku! muloŋa ifuku daYehova didi kwakwihi; dakenza neyi kujilumuka kukufuma kudi Chinaweji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakudya hiyaketuka dehi kumesu etuku? Muzaŋalu nikutiya kuwaha hiyaketuka dehi kwitala daNzambi yetuku?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbutu hijikutokela mwishina damakenka aju; nkalaŋa jashala dehi jamukunkulwayi; matala akusweka yakudya ahumoka dehi, muloŋa tidiku yinakaŋanyi dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O chakwabawu anyama! Nyikanka yaŋombi hiyikululuta, hiyanamoni kwakudiilaku. Nyikanka yanyikoku yinamoni ihuŋu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi Yehova, nukudilila kudeyi; muloŋa kesi kalasha dehi matahu adyaloŋa ayimuna mwisaŋa, nyilaŋu yakesi yocha dehi nyitondu yakumpata yejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwalala anyama amumpata adi nakuhaakwila kudeyi, muloŋa tuloŋa twoma dehi, ni kesi kalasha dehi matahu amwisaŋa kwadiilaŋawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
